  "details": "Description\n\nmotion smoothing causes major visual artifacting in both eyes. inputs are also not properly registered unless button is pressed 100%, eg gripping a pen requires clicking the grip button instead of pressing most of the way down. controller triggers void inputs unless trigger is firmly pressed.\n\nReproduction Steps\n\nartifacting: turn on motion smoothing in steam's vr settings\n\ninput issues: interact with the menus casually, try typing a sentence, or grab a pen without pressing buttons to 100% strength.\n\nDetails\n\n- Category: Performance\n\n- Frequency: Always\n\n---\n\nplatform: SteamFrame (platform: Android - SteamFrame, store: Steam, headset: None)\n\nrawPlatform: Android\n\nclientVersion: 2026.4.1-1936-2a7be9d59b-Release\n\nunityVersion: 6000.0.67f1-DWR\n\nIn-Client Report\n\n---\n\n**Log file:** [output_log_2026-11-19_01-35-10.txt](https://api.vrchat.cloud/api/1/file/file_9882f2d2-46a4-42a0-9f2e-1e6ba726079a/1/file)",
